      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. Can you make it a bit more detailed? I'm worried about the buffer times. Specifically, can you add more granular steps for the AV testing phase? I want to make sure we have contingencies for when things don't go according to plan, like if a microphone fails or the projector won't connect.",
